!/project/data/parquet/README.md
/project/data/output/cleaned/*
!/project/data/output/cleaned/README.md
/project/data/output/out_of_use/_outputs/*
!/project/data/output/out_of_use/_outputs/README.md
/project/data/output/sampled_km/*
!/project/data/output/sampled_km/README.md
/project/data/output/kmeans_full_result/*
!/project/data/output/kmeans_full_result/README.md
/project/data/output/bi_aggregates_compact/*
!/project/data/output/bi_aggregates_compact/README.md
/project/data/output/if_results_rowkeyed/full_scores_rowkeyed/*
!/project/data/output/if_results_rowkeyed/full_scores_rowkeyed/README.md
/project/data/output/xgb_cost_calibration/sample5pct/*
!/project/data/output/xgb_cost_calibration/sample5pct/README.md
